  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "After Seok-Hyun's death, Sung-Yun lives a shattered daily life, until Jae-Han, his college classmate, appears before him. Jae-Han, who had secretly loved Sung-Yun during their university days, persistently sticks to Sung-Yun, determined to restore him to his former self. Sung-Yun, unable to discern Jae-Han's intentions, feels uncomfortable. Yet, as Sung-Yun struggles to move on from Seok-Hyun, he gradually begins to accept Jae-Han...\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
